# Line endings are part of the code: the pre-commit hook and CI (tools/check_line_endings.py) refuse a change to
# them. In the repository every text file is LF; checkouts are LF too, except the Windows scripts (CRLF on disk).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
MANIFEST.json -text
MANIFEST.sig -text
*.sh text eol=lf
*.png binary
